    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/releases/tag/viable%2Fstrict%2F1792407148"/>
    <title>viable/strict/1792407148: [Special] Improve accuracy of erfinv near 1 (#201187)</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;p&gt;By using erfc instead of erf for the approximation and adding 3rd step of Newton-Raphson approximation for double&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply the same fix to MPS. Metal erfinv never had Newton-Raphson refinement: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;1711213981&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/101507&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/pytorch/pytorch/pull/101507/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/101507&quot;&gt;#101507&lt;/a&gt; ported the CPU rational approximation but dropped the correction steps (Metal had no erf at the time), leaving it accurate to only ~8e-6 relative (~67 fp32 eps), which was masked by the 1e-4 float32 OpInfo tolerance. CUDA uses the builtin &lt;code&gt;erfinv&lt;/code&gt; and needs no change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Add &lt;code&gt;test_erfinv_near_endpoints&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;TestUnaryUfuncs&lt;/code&gt; so it runs on all devices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fixes &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5883306553&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/201178&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/pytorch/pytorch/issues/201178/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/201178&quot;&gt;#201178&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Authored with the help of Claude Code.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:noreply@anthropic.com&quot;&gt;noreply@anthropic.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Pull Request resolved: &lt;a class=&quot;issue-link js-issue-link&quot; data-error-text=&quot;Failed to load title&quot; data-id=&quot;5885779089&quot; data-permission-text=&quot;Title is private&quot; data-url=&quot;https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/issues/201187&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/pytorch/pytorch/pull/201187/hovercard&quot; href=&quot;https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/pull/201187&quot;&gt;#201187&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Approved by: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/fadara01&quot;&gt;https://github.com/fadara01&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Skylion007&quot;&gt;https://github.com/Skylion007&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
